  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/mod-titles/more-smithing-tables.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsA42pp6cuX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/pnk2u/More-Smithing-Tables\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpnku\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pnku/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieonstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/a-creation-by-lieon-studio.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/requires-quad.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h1>Больше стольев для кузницы</h1>\n<p>Пополните свои постройки красочными инструментами и броней, теперь что каждый тип дерева имеет свой собственный стол для кузницы.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/More-Smithing-Tables/pres/cf_desc_banner.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>Добавление 12 новых <em>столов для кузницы</em> в Minecraft.</h2>\n<hr>\n<h1>Совместимо с <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quad</a> 1.3.0+:</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/wfhve.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\nГлядя через окно избы ремесленника сельской равнины на рыбацкую хату: можно увидеть, что вместо обычного <em>стола для кузницы</em>, <em>еловых бочек</em> и обычного <em>schranks</em>, село генерируется с <em><strong>дубовым столом для кузницы</strong></em>, <em><strong>дубовыми бочками</strong></em> (из <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-barrel-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Barrel Variants</a>) и <em><strong>дубовым сундуком</strong></em> (из <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-chest-variations-lieonlion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Chest Variants</a>).</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
